{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\eng\\120.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "in the mid-1980s, bypassing landline systems altogether.", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[344, 286], [1214, 166], [1221, 219], [352, 339]]}, {"text": "Conversations were instead transmitted through signals", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[345, 338], [1200, 222], [1207, 275], [353, 391]]}, {"text": "20mm", "conf": 0.549, "box": [[1545, 416], [1614, 429], [1607, 461], [1538, 448]]}, {"text": "Coltphonet", "conf": 0.82, "box": [[1504, 448], [1608, 469], [1603, 493], [1499, 472]]}, {"text": "the intornet", "conf": 0.735, "box": [[1531, 481], [1630, 502], [1625, 525], [1526, 504]]}, {"text": "But by the mid-1990s, they had gotten much smaller (and", "conf": 0.945, "box": [[342, 491], [1236, 385], [1243, 442], [349, 548]]}, {"text": "cheaper) and were called cellular (or cell) phones.", "conf": 0.943, "box": [[347, 551], [1083, 460], [1089, 506], [353, 597]]}, {"text": "Without a doubt, they have become more powerful and", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[345, 654], [1194, 562], [1198, 605], [350, 697]]}, {"text": "smarter than ever before. Most of us nowadays carry the", "conf": 0.959, "box": [[340, 700], [1208, 613], [1214, 666], [345, 753]]}, {"text": "world in our pocket! It is amazing but true. A mobile phone", "conf": 0.945, "box": [[339, 750], [1256, 666], [1261, 719], [344, 803]]}, {"text": "can make us connected to the rest of the world within", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[339, 807], [1158, 730], [1162, 776], [344, 853]]}, {"text": "seconds.", "conf": 0.741, "box": [[341, 864], [468, 852], [472, 890], [344, 902]]}, {"text": "Today. phones take pictures, connect us to the Internet, and", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[338, 907], [1260, 833], [1264, 885], [342, 958]]}, {"text": "even enable us to see one another as we converse.", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[339, 964], [1103, 904], [1106, 944], [342, 1004]]}, {"text": "Advances continue at a rate that is impossible to keep track", "conf": 0.945, "box": [[337, 1008], [1255, 947], [125